 'https://www.biyanicolleges.org/department-of-science/'
 'https://www.biyanicolleges.org/department-of-information-technology/'
 'https://www.biyanicolleges.org/department-of-visual-arts/'
 'https://www.biyanicolleges.org/course/ba-college-in-jaipur/'
)
i=0
